          "unsupported_reason": "The evidence confirms that document_id_embeddings and passage_id_embeddings are added to passages (evidence 0, 10, 14, 17), but the passage_id_embedding is a learned nn.Embedding (evidence 13, 16), not a sinusoidal encoding. The sinusoidal positional encoding (get_passage_positional_encoding, evidence 3-9) is a separate method that is not shown to be called within the forward/rerank path where the addition occurs. The document_id embedding is also a learned embedding, not explicitly 'dynamic' in the sense of being computed per-retrieval beyond the modulo arithmetic. The core addition operation is supported, but the 'sinusoidal passage-position encoding' characterization of passage_id_embedding is not supported by the evidence in the forward/rerank path."
        },
